(\\tfrac46 - \\tfrac36 = \\tfrac16\\).","tutor":{"goal":["1/6"],"forbid":["1"],"goalRe":"1\\s*/\\s*6"}},{"id":"mtk-c1-5","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"sedang","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"\\(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\) × \\(\\tfrac{1}{3}\\) = ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac{2}{5}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{1}{6}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{2}{6}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{1}{5}\\)"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Pembilang × pembilang dan penyebut × penyebut: \\(\\tfrac{1 \\times 1}{2 \\times 3} = \\tfrac16\\). Artinya setengah dari sepertiga.","tutor":{"goal":["1/6"],"forbid":["1"],"goalRe":"1\\s*/\\s*6"}},{"id":"mtk-c1-6","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"sedang","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"1,5 + 2,75 = ....","options":["3,25","4,25","4,80","4,2"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Luruskan koma: 1,50 + 2,75 = 4,25.","tutor":{"goal":["4,25","4.25"],"forbid":["4,25","4.25"]}},{"id":"mtk-c1-7","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"sulit","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"Satu adonan kue membutuhkan \\(\\tfrac{3}{4}\\) kg tepung. Berapa tepung untuk 4 adonan?","options":["3 kg","\\(4\\tfrac{3}{4}\\) kg","\\(\\tfrac{3}{16}\\) kg","1 kg"],"answer":0,"explanation":"\\(4 \\times \\tfrac34 = \\tfrac{12}{4} = 3\\) kg.","tutor":{"goal":["3"],"forbid":["3"]}},{"id":"mtk-c1-8","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"sulit","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"\\(2\\tfrac{1}{2}\\) − \\(1\\tfrac{3}{4}\\) = ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac{3}{4}\\)","\\(1\\tfrac{1}{4}\\)","\\(1\\tfrac{3}{4}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{1}{4}\\)"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Ubah ke desimal: 2,5 − 1,75 = 0,75 = \\(\\tfrac34\\). Atau \\(\\tfrac{10}{4} - \\tfrac74 = \\tfrac34\\).","tutor":{"goal":["3/4","0,75"],"forbid":["3"],"goalRe":"3\\s*/\\s*4|0[,.]75"}},{"id":"mtk-c1-9","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"sulit","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"\\(\\tfrac{3}{4}\\) : 3 = ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac{1}{4}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{9}{4}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{3}{7}\\)","\\(\\tfrac{4}{9}\\)"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Tiga perempat dibagi tiga sama banyak: masing-masing \\(\\tfrac14\\).","tutor":{"goal":["1/4"],"forbid":["1"],"goalRe":"1\\s*/\\s*4"}},{"id":"mtk-c1-10","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"penalaran","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"Sinta menulis \\(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\) + \\(\\tfrac{1}{3}\\) = \\(\\tfrac{2}{5}\\). Cara cepat untuk menunjukkan bahwa jawaban itu pasti keliru adalah ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac{2}{5}\\) lebih kecil dari \\(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\), padahal \\(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\) sudah ditambah sesuatu","\\(\\tfrac{2}{5}\\) adalah pecahan","Penyebut 5 bilangan ganjil","Tidak ada cara cepat"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Menambahkan bilangan positif pasti membuat hasilnya lebih besar. \\(\\tfrac25 = 0{,}4\\) lebih kecil dari \\(\\tfrac12 = 0{,}5\\), jadi pasti keliru. Jawaban yang benar \\(\\tfrac56\\).","tutor":{"goalRe":"\\\\tfrac\\{2\\}\\{5\\} lebih","traps":{"1":"frac-add-across"}}},{"id":"mtk-c1-11","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"penalaran","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"Setiap hari sebuah keluarga membuang \\(\\tfrac{1}{5}\\) dari 2 kg nasi yang dimasak. Berapa kg nasi yang terbuang dalam seminggu?","options":["2,8 kg","0,4 kg","10 kg","1,4 kg"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Sehari \\(\\tfrac15 \\times 2 = 0{,}4\\) kg. Seminggu 7 × 0,4 = 2,8 kg. Memasak secukupnya dan menyimpan sisa dengan benar mengurangi makanan terbuang.","tutor":{"goal":["2,8","2.8"],"forbid":["2,8","2.8"]},"sdg":[2,12]},{"id":"mtk-c1-12","concept":"matematika:mtk-c1:bilangan","level":"penalaran","elemen":"Bilangan","stem":"Mana yang lebih besar, 0,7 atau \\(\\tfrac{2}{3}\\)?","options":["0,7","\\(\\tfrac{2}{3}\\)","sama besar","tidak bisa dibandingkan"],"answer":0,"explanation":"\\(\\tfrac23 \\approx 0{,}667\\), lebih kecil dari 0,7. Ubah ke bentuk yang sama sebelum membandingkan.","tutor":{"goal":["0,7"],"forbid":["0,7"]}}],"lessonId":"mtk-c1-pecahan-desimal"}